description	"Cad Bane

A callous, quick-footed, Dual Pistol-wielding Bounty Hunter. Nice hat.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 7% faster RoF
- Dual LL-30 Blaster Pistols (Clone Pistol 3)
-- 5% more velocity
- Wrist Gauntlet Heavy Darts (WESTAR 3)
-- Pushes on hit
-- 100% more damage/FP drain
-- 100% slower RoF
-- 30% less velocity
-- Mag reload
-- Primary fire only
- Quick Draw (Clone Rifle 1)
-- Drains on hit
-- Hitscan rounds
-- 400% more damage/FP drain
-- 200% slower RoF
-- 75% slower reload
-- Heavyweight
- Wrist Gauntlet Flamethrower
- Frag Grenade (2)

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Healing (1)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Jetboots (Jetpack)
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS4]"